      "The left IC23 source has its BF branch diamond at c45/r29 and an immediate c45/r33 corner before printed prefix8 in 8D12. BF input text starts at c46 and its wire point is c45; the native BF incoming crop confirms no extra horizontal lead before the prefix.",
      "AZ native input offsets 1,2,4,5; BA and BB offsets1,3,5. AX wedged B03 output owns c115 rail, AS.D12 and AZ.B05/BA.B09/BB.B12 diamonds. External R REG BIT00 uses separate c112 rail to BB.B13; RX-format uses c113 to AZ.B04; forced-AM uses c114 and also AS.D11. Preserve every native unjoined crossing.",
